:: Millers Babysitting Bath Time [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> are walking around, you notice the time on the clock and remember the schedule <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> gave you. <span style="color:Yellow">It is time for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s bath, and he told you to make sure the boy took one. After that, he is supposed to get into bed.</span> While you don’t believe he would do a sniff test to ensure his own son bathed, you’re not against the idea of getting him nude in a tub and call the boy over, telling him it’s time for his bath. <br>

