<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Awww, do I have to?”</span> He asks, though you get the idea it is less about him not wanting to take a bath but rather him trying to see what he can get away with while you’re here. But you are firm, telling him he has to get in the tub <span style="color:Pink">or you’ll strip him down and toss him in yourself.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, noooo!”</span> He says, covering the front of his bottoms with his hands, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t want you to see my wiener! Haha. Okay, I’ll go get in the bath. I’ll do a good job, so no peeking!”</span> He sticks his tongue out at you as he rushes towards his bathroom. <span style="color:Pink">A moment later, you find the boy’s clothes scattered across his bedroom floor and hear him in the bathroom splashing and laughing away.</span> <br>
