<span style="color:Pink">You walk over and grab the blanket, taking a moment to look at how cute and snug his onesie is, before pulling the blanket over his body and tucking him in. You didn’t expect him to be so easy to be put to sleep.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, I am pretty tired…”</span> He yawns, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And I figured I should be a good boy… Since I’m being a good boy, can I have a kiss goodnight? Daddy always gives me one.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He blushes as he looks at you with a shy smile. You smirk at the boy, before leaning down and planting a cute little kiss on his forehead, causing the boy to giggle and wiggle about.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>. Today was fun.”</span> He smiles, getting comfortable in his bed, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ll see you later.”</span> He gives you a little wave, knowing you’re not leaving yet, but also knowing you’ll be gone when he wakes up. <span style="color:Pink">You give him a wave back and turn out the light, watching as the boy’s eyes close and he falls asleep.</span> <br>
